blood spattered coffin blizzard~
This black primordial coffin hovers effortlessly above a smooth marble pedestal bounded 
with many scarlet rubies. The finely crafted age-old coffin has no doubt been through 
many centuries unharmed. An aura which engulfs all angles of this resting place, 
unmistakably dispatches any intruder attempting to find out the wonders which are
concealed on the inside. You spot the name "Blizzard" inscribed on a stone slab on the 
surface of the coffin as you are overwhelmed with energy.
~
